# ShasthoSetu Frontend UI Standards

1. **Theme & Styling**:
   - Dark sapphire glassmorphism: `#050B14`, `#0F172A`, cyan/teal neon accents (`#38bdf8`, `#14b8a6`, `#34d399`).
   - Tailwind utility classes combined with custom glass panels (`ss-sapphire-card`, `ss-glass-panel`).

2. **Bilingual Requirement (Bengali + English)**:
   - All patient-facing and doctor-facing components must support seamless EN/BN toggle via `useI18n()`.
   - Bengali typography must use readable sans fonts (SolaimanLipi / Noto Sans Bengali fallbacks).

3. **Accessibility & Responsive**:
   - WCAG 2.1 AA compliant contrast.
   - All interactive elements must have aria labels and focus indicators.
   - Fully responsive for mobile viewports (minimum 360px width) up to 4K displays.
